{"symbol":"SCDL","yahoo":"SCDL.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Safety Controls & Devices Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Engineering & Construction","website":"https://www.safetygroup.in","about":"Safety Controls & Devices Limited engaged in the engineering, procurement, and construction business in India. The company engages in the installation of substations, construction of solar plants, and installation of firefighting equipment. It operates in multiple sectors including power transmission and distribution, solar infrastructure and grid integration, EV charging infrastructure, fire protection systems, healthcare, and institutional infrastructure. It also engages in designing, engineering, supplying, installing, erecting, testing, and commissioning transmission substations; and design, install, and supply services for fire equipment, firefighting systems, and fire alarms. In addition, the company caters to government entities and undertakings including various state and central government power utilities, private power entities, and renewable energy developers. Further, it operates in the fire protection business, to ensure safety and compliance of industrial, commercial, and residential spaces; and the healthcare sector, for the construction of hospitals. Safety Controls & Devices Limited was incorporated in 2015 and is based in Lucknow, India.","updated":"2026-09-30T12:15:01+00:00","quote":{"price":72.0,"prevClose":71.0,"marketCap":142.75,"high52":107.98,"low52":54.25,"pe":15.64,"bookValue":42.49,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":29.04,"shares":1.9827,"insiders":66.31,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2026-04-13","2026-04-15","2026-04-16","2026-04-17","2026-04-20","2026-04-21","2026-04-22","2026-04-23","2026-04-24","2026-04-27","2026-04-28","2026-04-29","2026-04-30","2026-05-04","2026-05-05","2026-05-06","2026-05-07","2026-05-08","2026-05-11","2026-05-12","2026-05-13","2026-05-14","2026-05-15","2026-05-18","2026-05-19","2026-05-20","2026-